["note","AOC-S1-T2",1787589725,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d~w-AOC-S1-T2",{"msg":"Seams: (1) output.NewEnvelope + MarshalJSON for {count, named payload[], help[]}; (2) output.WriteEnvelope to an io.Writer (stdout); (3) output.Classify on cobra Annotations, default agent-facing, MarkProtocolOutput for explicit opt-out. No cobra import in internal/output (depguard). harness-hook is the only command that opts out.","note_id":"note-1787589725451334324"}]
